  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The Smart Infrastructure & Discovery Update:\n      [New Features]\n      - Integrated FastReflection engine: Centralized metadata scanning with static caching for O(1) contract retrieval.\n      - Event-Driven Plugin System: Added FileSystemWatcher with a 2s debounce mechanism for real-time plugin discovery and cache invalidation.\n      - Automated LuciferConfig: Configuration properties are now automatically mapped via contract scanning.\n      - Automated LuciferCMD: Console commands are now globally discovered across all loaded assemblies and plugins.\n\n      [Improvements]\n      - Optimized Assembly Filtering: Enhanced ShouldScan logic to bypass 90%+ of system/third-party assemblies, significantly reducing startup latency.\n      - Thread-Safe Cache Management: Implemented lock-free cache resetting for high-concurrency environments.\n      - Memory Optimization: Leveraged Span<T> and IsDefined checks to minimize allocations during infrastructure setup.\n\n      [Breaking Changes]\n      - Default configuration file renamed from '.env' to '.lucifercore' for framework-specific identification.\n      - Moved assembly filtering logic from LuciferDLL to FastReflection.",
